<title>FINLAND: ARCTOS SAYS HAS SOLD TURKISTUOTTAJAT STAKE.</title>
<headline>ARCTOS SAYS HAS SOLD TURKISTUOTTAJAT STAKE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish investment house Arctos Capital Oy said on Friday that it had sold its entire stake in fur company Turkistuottajat Oy for 76.4 million markka.  </p>
<p>&quot;Arctos Capital has sold today all of its Turkistuottajat C-shares,&quot; Arctos said in a statement.</p>
<p>Before the deal, Arctos had 21.43 percent of shares and 5.7 percent of votes.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 6805 0240</p>
</text>
